title: "Docling GUI: Batch Document Conversion Desktop App for docling"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ikaros-521"
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ikaros-521/docling-gui"
url: "https://github.com/Ikaros-521/docling-gui"
abstract: "A free, open-source desktop GUI and CLI that recursively batch-converts all docling-supported document formats (PDF, Office, images, audio, HTML, EPUB, email; 37 format families) into Markdown, HTML, lossless JSON, DocTags XML or plain text. Fully local and offline, for Windows, macOS and Linux."
keywords:
  - docling
  - document conversion
  - PDF to Markdown
  - OCR
  - batch conversion
  - RAG
  - PySide6
  - GUI